|--------|-------------------|-------------------|------------|
| Path-search mark slot (pointer in int) | `PathNode.h:107` `intptr_t m_marks[4]`; `PathSearch.cpp:188-199` `intptr_t mark` + `reinterpret_cast<intptr_t>` | `PathNode.h:99` `int m_marks[4]`; `PathSearch.cpp` still `int` mark path | **YES — A widened, B did not** |
| Win32 `this` in window userdata | `StatusWindow.cpp:151` `SetWindowLongPtr`/`GWLP_USERDATA`/`LONG_PTR` | `StatusWindow.cpp:151` (same API, slimmer comments) | Convergent |
| Hash/sort key from shader template ptr | `StaticShader.cpp:298` `std::hash<uintptr_t>{}(...)` | `StaticShader.cpp:289` `reinterpret_cast<int>(&getStaticShaderTemplate())` | **YES — A hashes, B truncates high bits** |
| Call-stack storage | `DebugHelp.h` + `CallStack.*`: `uintptr_t*` (Phase 31/33); `DebugHelp.cpp:511+` `RtlCaptureContext`, full `Rip` | `DebugHelp.cpp:484` `uint64 *callStack`; commit `70cbe9566` widens buffers | Convergent goal; **A adds OOM minidump reserve (`DebugHelp.cpp:424-427`) B removed** |
| IOCP completion key | `TcpClient.cpp:523` `ULONG_PTR completionKey` | Same file touched; B line set equivalent | Convergent |
| Freed-poison sentinel | `ByteStream.cpp:350` `reinterpret_cast<uintptr_t>` vs `0xefef…ULL` | Not present (base `unsigned int` compare) | **A only** |
| Trait-routed bind cast | `VoidBindSecond.h:33` `if constexpr (is_pointer_v && is_integral_v)` | Same file touched; B keeps simpler form | A stricter |
| MemoryManager address logging | Phase 31 sweep (`MemoryManager.cpp` etc.) | `MemoryManager.cpp` touched in x64 port | Partial overlap |

